b} had the ball (64%) and lost: possession is like a gym membership, you still have to use it.","Big chances (xG ≥ 0.30): 1 for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}.","Shooting gallery: 18 shots for {T:home:sub}, against 8."],"impact":"Man of the match, by our chalk: W. Rooney (1 goal, 0.87 xG, 0.32 xT). Moral of the story: football is not won on points."}},"s2":{"fr":{"lead":"Pas de compositions officielles dans ces données, alors on lit le terrain : avec le ballon, {T:home:sub} s'organisait en 4-2-4, {T:away:sub} en 3-3-3-1.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} change de peau selon la phase : 4-2-4 avec le ballon, 3-2-5 sans.","{T:away:Sub} change de peau selon la phase : 3-3-3-1 avec le ballon, 3-4-3 sans.","Le couloir préféré {T:home:de} : l'axe (26 % des touches).","{T:home:Sub} a passé du temps chez l'adversaire : 31 % de ses touches dans le dernier tiers.","{T:away:Sub} a joué large : 55 % des touches dans les deux couloirs extérieurs."],"impact":"Le plan {T:away:de} a tenu jusqu'au bout. Les positions moyennes ne disent pas tout, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"No official line-ups in this data, so we read the pitch: in possession, {T:home:sub} set up in a 4-2-4, {T:away:sub} in a 3-3-3-1.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 4-2-4 with the ball, 3-2-5 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-3-1 with the ball, 3-4-3 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (26% of touches).","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 31% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:sub} played wide: 55% of touches in the two outer lanes."],"impact":"{T:away:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"{T:home:Sub} a chassé plus haut et plus vite : 5,1 passes adverses par action défensive, contre 13,6.","keys":["Réaction à la perte : {T:home:sub} récupère 20 % de ses ballons perdus en moins de 5 s, contre 10 %. Une meute.","11 récupérations hautes pour {T:away:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but.","Données Wyscout : pas de pressions enregistrées, on lit le pressing à travers les tacles, interceptions et fautes."],"impact":"Ironie du soir : c'est l'équipe qui pressait le moins qui gagne. {T:away:Sub} a laissé venir, encaissé le pressing, et puni."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} hunted higher and faster: 5.1 opponent passes per defensive action, against 13.6.","keys":["Reaction to losing it: {T:home:sub} win back 20% of lost balls within 5 s, against 10%. A pack.","11 high regains for {T:away:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal.","Wyscout data: no pressure events, so pressing is read through tackles, interceptions and fouls."],"impact":"Irony of the night: the team that pressed less won. {T:away:sub} let it come, absorbed the press and punished."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"D'un côté, {T:away:sub} et ses petits triangles près du ballon (−0,02) ; de l'autre, {T:home:sub} et ses couloirs bien rangés (−0,95).","keys":["{T:home:Sub} : 37 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 42 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : W. Rooney, impliqué dans 120 passes entre titulaires.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : B. Bjarnason, impliqué dans 43 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football relationniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"On one side, {T:away:sub} and their little triangles near the ball (−0.02); on the other, {T:home:sub} and their tidy lanes (−0.95).","keys":["{T:home:sub}: 37% short passes (under 15 m), against 42% on average.","The hub of {T:home:pos} network: W. Rooney, involved in 120 passes between starters.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: B. Bjarnason, involved in 43 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, relational football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Tr