sse signée B. Sævarsson à la 23e minute (+0,14 xT)."],"impact":"{T:home:Sub} a créé plus de menace, mais {T:away:sub} a converti la sienne (1,10 xG au final). Amener le ballon près du but, c'est la moitié du travail."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 2.27 for {T:home:sub}, 0.78 for {T:away:sub}. Top creator: D. Sturridge, 0.57 xT on his own (25% of his team's threat).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by H. Kane in minute 78 (+0.15 xT).","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by B. Sævarsson in minute 23 (+0.14 xT)."],"impact":"{T:home:sub} created more threat, but {T:away:sub} converted theirs (1.10 xG in the end). Getting the ball near goal is only half the job."}},"s8":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur l'ensemble de la compétition, K. Walker pointe au 1er rang des latéraux (sur 67). Ce match, c'était aussi une vitrine.","keys":["D. Sturridge ({T:home:bare}) : 2e des attaquants sur 46.","W. Rooney ({T:home:bare}) : 4e des attaquants sur 46.","E. Dier ({T:home:bare}) : 10e des milieux sur 90.","Joueurs dans le top 5 de leur poste : 3 pour {T:home:sub}, 0 pour {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"Le collectif a battu les individualités : {T:away:sub} gagne avec moins de joueurs au sommet des classements."},"en":{"lead":"Across the whole competition, K. Walker ranks 1st among full-backs (out of 67). This match was also a showcase.","keys":["D. Sturridge ({T:home:sub}): 2nd of 46 forwards.","W. Rooney ({T:home:sub}): 4th of 46 forwards.","E. Dier ({T:home:sub}): 10th of 90 midfielders.","Players in their position's top 5: 3 for {T:home:sub}, 0 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"The collective beat the individuals: {T:away:sub} won with fewer players at the top of the rankings."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Jumeau statistique pour W. Rooney : Florian Wirtz ({TN:Germany}, Euro 2024), similaire à 83 %. Mêmes habitudes, autre maillot.","keys":["E. Dier ↔ Aurélien Tchouaméni (Euro 2024, 97 %).","J. Hart ↔ David de Gea (Coupe du monde 2018, 97 %).","H. Kane ↔ Cri